{"key":"StoryData/P11105.json|/dataList/12/content","kr_sha":"43a368a9444d340cac05003a673dd66e43948ae3dcd455590b76bca32bb160c6","zh":"儘管事務所與協會都是收尾人所組成的組織，但它們的性質卻不盡相同。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryData/P11105.json|/dataList/13/content","kr_sha":"cc0c0250e67590e12be65f4a44923674bc6d0f9ff632937bc9f1aa69f762d1b3","zh":"雖然並不能說協會是事務所的上位存在，但其無論是職員數量還是工作規模都大得多……因此，與協會保持合作關係的事務所也很多。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryData/P11105.json|/dataList/14/content","kr_sha":"945006f2f0ac1c263f5cdf33e369491cdec3b1724d2bf5eac5f9b8425423bfb5","zh":"許多人認為事務所的主要收入來源是接受個人委託。但如果這個事務所尚且不為人知，被客戶選擇也不是那麼容易的事情。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryData/P11105.json|/dataList/15/content","kr_sha":"8c648802ac143d17617c4165bf3977ce271b8e282315632cba053c24a23b326d","zh":"因此，初出茅廬的事務所經常接取所謂「公開委託」。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryData/P11105.json|/dataList/16/content","kr_sha":"d2ee89395fdb12f09d3e05438693f3592868713c8b3ee0ffeeec2841777797d2","zh":"協會會從接取的眾多委託中挑選一些，公開出來以便事務所接取。但這基於是先到先得的規則，所以連續數日都搶不到工作的情況也有。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryData/P11105.json|/dataList/17/content","kr_sha":"9addfbe16256e89a4bc2a61d4103881bd4f4324a400c2d4c25cbc6013d27f4b4","zh":"協會下屬的事務所，或者是與協會內部人員有關係的事務所也許能接到轉包委託，但這孩子卻不具備二者中的任何一個。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryData/P11105.json|/dataList/18/content","kr_sha":"a3f28bf277926dbccf2cbc8506e9b70b781f9dd7b65fee840f157ec756d328c3","zh":"當這孩子開設她自己的事務所時……她所夢想的是一個緩慢而輕鬆的生活，做一些適當的委託，每夜都喝著美酒。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryData/P11105.json|/dataList/19/content","kr_sha":"9764fce97d76debab0ffa172514f842d7eee931151bed447e33e004d367f3da0","zh":"在能接取到公開委託的那一天工作，當天色已晚的時候喝酒。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
